@api = http://localhost:5241

### List checks
GET {{api}}/api/checks
Accept: application/json

### Create a check
# @name create
POST {{api}}/api/checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "intervalSeconds": 60,
  "failureThreshold": 3
}

### Create an invalid check (expect 400 with code "Check.InvalidUrl")
POST {{api}}/api/checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken",
  "url": "ftp://example.com"
}

### Get the check created above
@checkId = {{create.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{api}}/api/checks/{{checkId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update it
PUT {{api}}/api/checks/{{checkId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example (every 5 min)",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "intervalSeconds": 300,
  "failureThreshold": 2
}

### Pause, then pause again (expect 409 "Check.AlreadyPaused")
POST {{api}}/api/checks/{{checkId}}/pause

###
POST {{api}}/api/checks/{{checkId}}/resume

### History (fills up as the Functions app runs the check)
GET {{api}}/api/checks/{{checkId}}/results?take=20

### Delete
DELETE {{api}}/api/checks/{{checkId}}

### Open incidents
GET {{api}}/api/incidents?status=open
Accept: application/json

### All incidents
GET {{api}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter (expect 400 "Incident.InvalidStatusFilter")
GET {{api}}/api/incidents?status=sideways
